From 30633368bd5e20f540dbccb621564597939988e3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Petar G. Georgiev" <petarg@codeaurora.org>
Date: Thu, 7 May 2020 10:12:31 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] omxvideoenc: Add support for ROI encoding on QTI target

---
 omx/Makefile.am      |   3 +-
 omx/gstomxvideoenc.c | 273 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 omx/gstomxvideoenc.h |   3 +
 3 files changed, 278 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

